MID_SE_Hur_Pep_C: <EDH>
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_C_001: Greetings, Lady Ultand. We have come to extend a\ngesture for your loyal service. A reward, actually!
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_C_002: Hahaha. You've got such an eccentric way\nof talking.
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_C_003: Oh! Forget I said that! Your Majesty.\nYour...Highness?
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_C_004: Umm, how should I be acting toward you? Same as\nwith one of the gods, maybe?
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_C_005: You need not be so formal. Be at ease. Be...yourself.\nIt is our preference.
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_C_006: The art of casual conversation has been of great\ninterest to us since we first arrived in Dagsion.
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_C_007: Alright, I can do that. To be honest, all of this is a bit\nhard to believe.
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_C_008: All I wanted to do was rescue someone who'd gotten\nlost in lowtown.
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_C_009: Lost?! Nothing could be further from the truth! We\nhad indeed finally "lost" our entourage.
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_C_010: We came to Dagsion to see what its people were like.\nThe Fang's presence was making that impossible.
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_C_011: But that day...our curiosity took us into that shop,\nand that shopkeep accused us of thievery!
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_C_012: He got confused because you whipped out an\nexpensive-looking gold necklace.
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_C_013: People don't do that. So of course he assumed it\nwas stolen.
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_C_014: Such disrespect. Though perhaps it only proves that\nour disguise was working effectively.
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_C_015: Ah, but a fond memory now, as that brought you into\nour life!
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_C_016: You ditched your entourage. You couldn't buy\nanything. You were a fish out of water.
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_C_017: I'm just glad I found you. I couldn't possibly ignore \nsomeone with an empty tummy.
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_C_018: Your cooking was a revelation, Lady Ultand. We only\nwish it could be served at the royal palace.
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_C_019: Well, I'm just glad you enjoyed it.
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_C_020: You said you wanted to reward my "loyal service."\nIs that because I fed you?
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_C_021: You offered us haven and amity too—lodging and\nfriendship. We must show our gratitude.
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_C_022: Lady Ultand, we would like to extend to you an \ninvitation to come to Brigid...as our queen.
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_C_023: Invitation. To come to Brigid...
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_C_024: Wait! What?! You want me to be your queen?!
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_C_025: Of course. We are the king, you know.
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_C_026: Haha... Girl rescues lost boy. Boy is actually a king.\nBoy proposes to girl. That's a heck of a love story!
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_C_027: So then you agree! Upon returning to Brigid, we will\nhold a grand and proper ceremony.
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_C_028: H-hold on! This isn't something you can decide for\nme! Don't box me in like that.
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_C_029: Have we...offended you, Lady Ultand?
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_C_030: N-no! I just...have my own stuff to deal with!
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_C_031: Family and work and debt... It never ends!
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_C_032: Hm... Understood. Please, take some time to\nconsider our proposal.
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_C_033: But know that you ARE the queen of Brigid!\nThrough and through!
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_C_034: I JUST told you, you can't decide this for me!
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_B: <EDH>
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_B_001: Lady Ultand! Rejoice! We have solved your\npersonal dilemma.
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_B_002: "Dilemma"? You mean your sudden marriage\nproposal? Yeah, that knocked me for a loop.
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_B_003: Family, debt, work... This is all that prevents our love\nfrom blooming, yes?
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_B_004: Let us discuss family first. Bring them to Brigid, and\nwe will provide for them and give them a home.
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_B_005: As for the debt, we will shoulder it for you. Now that\njust leaves your work.
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_B_006: Peppe! You can't be serious!
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_B_007: Hm? Why? You do not believe us?
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_B_008: Lady Ultand. We are eternally bright and cheerful...\nbut sadness can cloud our sun.
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_B_009: Ours are honest feelings—love and gratitude. Your\ndoubt casts a shadow...
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_B_010: I see. You've put some thought into this.
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_B_011: I'm sorry. I feel I've mishandled this situation.
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_B_012: Do not fret. It is the mark of a good man to laugh and\nforgive his beloved's follies.
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_B_013: I'm flattered that you think of me this way, but I\ncan't be your queen.
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_B_014: For one thing, Brigid is far, far away. I'm sure the food\nand even the water would be unfamiliar and strange.
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_B_015: Not only that, but I just can't uproot my family.
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_B_016: As far as my debt and my job, those are things that\nI'm responsible for, not you.
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_B_017: Oh. We are...sorry to hear that.
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_B_018: Our thought was that you would welcome this.\nWe were mistaken.
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_B_019: Don't despair, Peppe. It's not that I don't admire you.
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_B_020: I just think we're better as friends.
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_B_021: Hehehe... Hahaha!
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_B_022: What now?!
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_B_023: Lady Ultand! You are a delight and a surprise!\nWe are falling for you anew.
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_B_024: You could be queen and live a life of ease. Yet you\nrefuse it.
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_B_025: Such inner strength! There is no one in the world\nmore worthy of being Brigid's queen!
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_B_026: Peppe, did you hear anything I just said?
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_B_027: Of course! It is because we listened to you that we\nfell in love yet again.
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_B_028: Still, love must flow both ways in a marriage. We\nwill concede for now.
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_B_029: But know that you are the queen of Brigid,\nthrough and through!
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_B_030: That's exactly what you said last time we talked\nabout this! I really don't think you're hearing me!
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_B_031: Our love for you could withstand death itself,\nLady Ultand...
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_B_032: We will wait, for we know one day you will grow to\nlove us in return. You will soon see.
MID_SE_Hur_Pep_B_033: I'm not falling for this. But I have to admit, his\npassion is almost endearing.